### Validate API key against the Keystore
GET {{keystoreUrl}}/validate/c723b678-4a87-406d-9084-7c39c7cef6f2/secrets
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

### Expected response:
# {
#   "valid": true,
#   "value": "yoco"
# }

###

### Get properties linked to an API key
GET {{keystoreUrl}}/apikey/c723b678-4a87-406d-9084-7c39c7cef6f2/property
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

### Expected response:
# {
#   "data": [
#     { "id": 3, "name": "environment", "value": "prod" },
#     { "id": 4, "name": "service",     "value": "github" }
#   ]
# }

###

### Example: calling a local route protected by requireApiKey
# GET {{keystoreUrl}}/your-route
# Accept: application/json
